  "source_sha256": "a27ffee91cc40b84eb53aff2f4e8b087aac948c637f661ffa15b088a4c2bcf5b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "945b4857c751382540f05538432fac6d3b41fce1278451f7b36000881dac9215",
      "text": "Sun Wukong’s\nOne Little Bite",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e1aedce007cb3107cc8395f153a9bf833c2c58d036b36e22d84b088374c09331",
      "text": "The sun was going down.\nSun Wukong hugged his peach.\n“Only peaches for me!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9443d1f627ca601a2dec9f11dd7577487bfb0f15270bb6bc91d2b30e90060068",
      "text": "“Come and help,” said Pigsy.\n“Let’s make supper!”\nWukong washed a carrot.\nSplash! His nose got wet.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89a3c7de010873a6d942892b6ba993a8a91707df6268aa2a520be97c16eda3af",
      "text": "Sandy stirred a little pot.\nA leaf fell onto\nWukong’s peach.\n“My peach has a hat!”\nHe gave a little giggle.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e9585716250155e4b86d3e25b1fcad80987a328b5bf1313715aefcface1625cd",
      "text": "A sweet smell filled the air.\nWukong asked, “What smells\nso good?”\n“A warm carrot,” said Sandy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "136542034cb9773708e3c162f6297972eb415ff687e6c63e227f9b4b9b7fd2c3",
      "text": "Wukong took one tiny bite.\n“Oh! Sweet and soft.”\nHe set his peach\nbeside his bowl.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a63a9914a9b926555e865527460e63c78628e8f88b71188ecbb32ac93719ae2c",
      "text": "“Try a little green leaf.”\nWukong tried a small leaf.\n“Hmm... soft and juicy!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "05c0a9706f322f61041149215d59b4d88029fd5989973da6098856c287e38e0b",
      "text": "He tried rice and tofu.\nSmall, soft tofu cubes.\nA little of this.\nA little of that.\n“My bowl has new friends!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a7d77d1a4bc054f713de1680d3ec5b8d9a58c73dfed3dfb9c6fe1e71cacd36f4",
      "text": "The moon was up.\nWukong ate one last peach\nbite.\n“I like carrots and rice, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ff0ded3b2db51a606c30597e29eaafb3bbf726b1791b53ca92e80b7ee05f06fa",
      "text": "Wukong snuggled into bed.\n“Goodnight, little bowl.\nGoodnight, friends.”\nTomorrow, he could try\nsomething new.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
